    </header>

    <!-- ==================== HERO SECTION ==================== -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span class="hero-badge"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> Free 7-Day Trial Available</span>
                <h1>Keep Your Wheels Moving & <span class="text-gold">Profits Growing</span></h1>
                <p>Professional US dispatch services for Owner-Operators. We handle load booking, rate negotiation, paperwork, and billing so you can focus on driving.</p>
                <div class="hero-buttons">
                    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Request Free Trial</a>
                    <a href="#services" class="btn btn-outline">Our Services</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== SERVICES SECTION ==================== -->
    <section id="services" class="services section-padding">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header text-center">
                <h2>Complete Dispatch <span class="text-gold">Support</span></h2>
                <p>From finding high-paying loads to handling back-office paperwork, we manage every detail of your freight operations.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="services-grid">
                <!-- Service 1 -->
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-search-location"></i></div>
                    <h3>Load Searching & Booking</h3>
                    <p>We scour major load boards and broker networks to find the highest paying freight that matches your route preferences and equipment type.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 2 -->
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i></div>
                    <h3>Rate Negotiation</h3>
                    <p>Our experienced dispatchers negotiate aggressively with brokers to secure top dollar per mile and ensure fair detention and layover pay.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 3 -->
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-file-contract"></i></div>
                    <h3>Paperwork Management</h3>
                    <p>We handle all rate confirmations, BOLs, POD submissions, and invoicing. Never worry about missing paperwork or delayed payments again.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 4 -->
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-headset"></i></div>
                    <h3>Broker Communication</h3>
                    <p>We serve as your single point of contact with brokers, handling check-calls, updates, and issue resolution while you stay on the road.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 5 -->
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-calculator"></i></div>
                    <h3>Billing & Settlements</h3>
                    <p>Accurate invoicing and settlement tracking. We ensure you get paid correctly and on time, with detailed breakdowns of every load.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 6 -->
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-route"></i></div>
                    <h3>Driver Coordination</h3>
                    <p>Strategic trip planning and route optimization to minimize deadhead miles and maximize your revenue per week.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== EQUIPMENT SECTION ==================== -->
    <section id="equipment" class="section-padding">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header text-center">
                <h2>Equipment We <span class="text-gold">Dispatch</span></h2>
                <p>Specialized support for all major trailer types across the United States.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="equipment-grid">
                <div class="equip-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586528116311-ad8dd3c8310d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Dry Van Trailer">
                    <div class="equip-overlay">
                        <p>Most Popular</p>
                        <h3>Dry Van</h3>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="equip-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616432043562-3671ea2e5242?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Reefer Trailer">
                    <div class="equip-overlay">
                        <p>Temperature Controlled</p>
                        <h3>Reefer</h3>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="equip-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519003722824-194d4455a60c?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Box Truck">
                    <div class="equip-overlay">
                        <p>Straight Truck</p>
                        <h3>Box Truck</h3>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="equip-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558618666-fcd25c85cd64?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Cargo Van">
                    <div class="equip-overlay">
                        <p>Expedited Freight</p>
                        <h3>Cargo Van</h3>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== COVERAGE SECTION ==================== -->
    <section id="coverage" class="coverage section-padding">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="coverage-wrapper">
                <div class="coverage-image">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1495539406979-bf61750d38ad?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="US Highway Trucking">
                </div>
                <div class="coverage-content">
                    <h2>Nationwide Coverage, <br><span class="text-gold">Regional Expertise</span></h2>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-gray); margin-bottom: 2rem;">While we book freight across all 48 contiguous states, our deep market knowledge in these key regions ensures you always get the best lanes and rates.</p>
                    
                    <ul class="coverage-list">
                        <li><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i> <strong>Midwest:</strong> Chicago, Detroit, Indianapolis, Minneapolis hubs</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i> <strong>East Coast:</strong> NYC, Philadelphia, Atlanta, Miami corridors</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i> <strong>Southern US:</strong> Dallas, Houston, Nashville, Charlotte lanes</li>
                    </ul>

                    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Start Hauling Today</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== ABOUT SECTION ==================== -->
    <section id="about" class="section-padding" style="background-color: var(--secondary-dark);">
        <div class="container text-center" style="max-width: 800px;">
            <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Why Choose <span class="text-gold">MO DISPATCH?</span></h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-gray); font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                We are a dedicated team of US-based dispatch professionals who understand the trucking industry from the ground up. We don't just book loads—we build partnerships with owner-operators to help them grow sustainable, profitable businesses. Our commitment is simple: transparent communication, aggressive rate negotiation, and reliable back-office support.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 3rem;">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-gold" style="font-size: 2.5rem;">24/7</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-gray); font-size: 0.9rem;">Support Availability</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-gold" style="font-size: 2.5rem;">US-Based</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-gray); font-size: 0.9rem;">Dispatch Team</p>
